<title>GERMANY: Douglas buys last stake in Christ Holding.</title>
<headline>Douglas buys last stake in Christ Holding.</headline>
<dateline>HAGEN, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German cosmetics retail chain Douglas Holding AG said on Wedensday it has taken over the remaining 34.5 percent share of Christ Holding GmbH, a jewellery company.</p>
<p>The transaction was retroactive to January 1, Douglas said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
